  "blocks": [
    {"type": "heading", "number": "77.2.2.3", "title": "降水头", "level": 4},
    {
      "type": "calculation-guidance",
      "text": "式(77.5)为Green–Ampt降水头关系。Δθ=θ_fs−θ_i；R=A_s/A_c=πr_s²/(πr_c²)；C=1−Δθ/R。H_t以内隐、非线性形式出现，宜用一系列(H_t,t)点拟合K_fs和α*；Δθ、R、H₀须独立测定，直接在环内蓄水时R=1。只求K_fs可按质地—结构估α*并用式(77.6)由H_a、t_a、Δθ直接求解；H_a=0时只需t_a和Δθ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "source-fidelity-note",
      "text": "中文式(77.6)仍沿用H_t下标，但公式说明和英文原章定义的是t_a时刻水位H_a；规范式全部改为H_a。表77.2的NP指数按英文原表恢复为1.37×10⁶ pores·m⁻²。"
    }
  ],
  "formulas": [
    {
      "label": "77.5",
      "plain": "t = Δθ/(C K_fs){R(H₀−H_t)/Δθ − (H₀+1/α*)/C ln[1 + C R(H₀−H_t)/(Δθ(H₀+1/α*))]}, C≠0",
      "latex": "t=\\frac{\\Delta\\theta}{CK_{fs}}\\left\\{\\frac{R(H_0-H_t)}{\\Delta\\theta}-\\frac{H_0+1/\\alpha^*}{C}\\ln\\left[1+\\frac{CR(H_0-H_t)}{\\Delta\\theta(H_0+1/\\alpha^*)}\\right]\\right\\},\\quad C\\ne0",
      "resultUnit": "T"
    },
    {
      "label": "77.6",
      "plain": "K_fs = Δθ/(C t_a){R(H₀−H_a)/Δθ − (H₀+1/α*)/C ln[1 + C R(H₀−H_a)/(Δθ(H₀+1/α*))]}, C≠0",
      "latex": "K_{fs}=\\frac{\\Delta\\theta}{Ct_a}\\left\\{\\frac{R(H_0-H_a)}{\\Delta\\theta}-\\frac{H_0+1/\\alpha^*}{C}\\ln\\left[1+\\frac{CR(H_0-H_a)}{\\Delta\\theta(H_0+1/\\alpha^*)}\\right]\\right\\},\\quad C\\ne0",
      "resultUnit": "L·T⁻¹"
    }
  ],
